      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "你是说，你也在找传说中的有袋鼷兽？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_surprised",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "莱伊",
            "content": "嗯。我知道自己听起来像异想天开......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4117_ray",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "不不不不不会——有袋鼷兽真的存在，我们亲眼见过的！有一只叫一撮毛的小家伙，陪伴了我们一路呢，对不对，阿梅？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_smile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "content": "嗯！另外，我记得在这座移动平台上也见到过它们。只是不知道现在这里人来人往的，它们还会不会回来呢......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_softsmile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "毕竟都是些善良又害羞的小家伙呢。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_relieved",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "莱伊",
            "content": "真的？能不能——请你们带我去找找它们？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4117_ray_surprised",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "走，我们现在就去！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_smile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "莱伊",
            "content": "稍等，我准备好的笔记本呢......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4117_ray_confused",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "content": "啊，原来你是学者吗？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_confused",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "莱伊",
            "content": "欸？不是。只是得把自己的话语记在笔记本上，否则，如果被有袋鼷兽偷走的话会很不方便。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4117_ray_thinking",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
